spans.s:
सम्-√ अर्च् P. -अर्चति, -ऋचति (pf. -आनृच, R.; -आनृचे, RV.),
to fix, establish, RV. i, 160, 4;
to honour, worship, adore, R.;
to adorn, decorate, VarBṛS. :
Caus. -अर्चयति, to honour &c., MBh.

सम्-√ अर्थ् (in some senses rather Nom. fr. सम्-अर्थ below) Ā. -अर्थयते (rarely P. ˚ति), to make fit or ready, prepare, RV.;
to finish, close, L.;
to connect with (instr.) in sense, construe (grammatically), Sāh.; Kull.;
to judge, think, contemplate, consider, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to suppose to be, take for (acc. with प्रति), Vikr. iv, 58;
to notice, perceive, find out, Kām.; Kum.; Śaṃk.;
to fix upon, determine, approve, R.;
to cheer up, comfort, encourage, Kathās.;
 समर्थय, often w.r. for समर्पय See सम्-√ ऋ.

सम्-आ-√ रुह् P. -रोहति, to ascend or rise to or upon (acc. loc., or उपरि), mount, enter (acc.), Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to advance towards or against (acc.), MBh.;
to enter upon, attain to, undertake, begin (with तुलाम्, ‘to become like or similar’), KauṣUp.; Mn. &c.:
Caus. -रोकयति, or -रोपयति, to cause to mount or ascend (two acc. or acc. and loc.), AV. &c. &c.;
to cause to rise (a star), MārkP.;
to place upon, impose, MBh.; R.; Kathās.;
to lift up, erect, raise (lit. and fig.), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to place in or among (acc.), Kāv.; Kathās.;
to deposit (the sacred fire) in (acc. or loc.), TS.; Br.;
to string (a bow), R.; BhP.;
to deliver over, entrust or commit to (loc.), MBh.;
to ascribe, attribute, transfer to (loc.), BhP.; Sarvad. :
Desid. See next.
